<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6323" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Calpē</span></b> , ēs, f.,
		= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κάλπη</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>one of the pillars of Hercules in</i>
			Hispania Baetica, now <i>Rock of Gibraltar</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 1, 5,
			3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 6, 8</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
			3</span></i>, prooem. § 4; 3, 1, 3, § 7; Asin. ap.
				<i><span class="en">Cic.
				Fam. 10, 32, 1</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ibera,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Herc. Oet. 1254</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Luc. 1, 555</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 71</span></i>
			(abl. scanned Calpĕ, <i><span class="en">Juv. 14,
				279</span></i>).—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Derivv. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Calpētā-nus</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., <i>of Calpe</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gurges,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Avien. Progn. 1620</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Calpētĭtānus</span></b> , a,
				um, adj., <i>of Calpe</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vada,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Avien. Arat. 1023</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
